+- **Time Complexity:** $O(1)$ per sample. The operation consists of a few multiplications and additions [S1, S2, unofficial].
+- **Memory Complexity:** $O(1)$ auxiliary memory. Requires storing the inverse volume dimensions or half-extents [S2, unofficial].
